@parry
title: Parry
subtitle: Spend turn using the sword gifted to him by the Scythian to parry the incoming attack. Does not work against all attacks, but against some attacks can even reflect them back. (2 stamina) [? if sc_plan == "parry" : - **this is our plan** ?]
on-arrival: {!
if (!Q.planning_combat) {
    window.clearCombatStatsIfNeeded();
    Q[Q.selected_combatant + "_action"] = "parry";

    if (Q.selected_combatant == "breitscheid") {
        Q.breitscheid_parries = (Q.breitscheid_parries || 0) + 1;

        var parryDialogues = {
            1: [
                ["breitscheid", "Desperate times| call for desperate measures.|"],
                ["doraemon", "Breitscheid brandishes a sword!!!"],
                ["random_other_combatant", "Where did you even GET that?|"],
                ["breitscheid", "Well, I had this Scythian friend in the Foreign Ministry.|.|.|"],
                ["breitscheid", "It's a long story, and I'm not super jazzed about it, but it basically involves the burdensome book of sinister sworcery known as the Megatome & how we got it."],
                ["random_other_combatant", "Wait, how |DID| we get it...?"],
                ["breitscheid", "From, like, a doomed timeline,| pretty much.|"],
                ["braun", "Wait, like Homestuck?|"],
                ["breitscheid", "What? No.| I don't think so, anyway. Let's just try to focus, man."],
                ["doraemon", "Breitscheid is prepared to parry!"],
            ],
            2: [
                ["breitscheid", "I've pretty much stopped trying to make sense of these things.|"],
                ["random_other_combatant", "What things?|"],
                ["breitscheid", "This whole woeful errand we're on."],
                ["random_other_combatant", "Really? It seems to me like you're still trying to make sense of it.|"],
                ["breitscheid", "Well, only cause, like...|"],
                ["breitscheid", "Listen, man, I'm a politician...|"],
                ["breitscheid", "But what's gotta be done's gotta be done.|"],
                ["doraemon", "Breitscheid is prepared to parry!"],
            ],
            3: [
                ["breitscheid", "Swordfighting, amirite?|"],
                ["random_other_combatant", "Yeah, still no clue where you picked that up from.|"],
                ["breitscheid", "The Scythian steppes.|"],
                ["doraemon", "Breitscheid is prepared to parry!"],
            ],
        };

        var dialogues = parryDialogues[Q.breitscheid_parries] || [
            ["breitscheid", "Here goes."],
            ["doraemon", "Breitscheid is prepared to parry!"],
        ];

        if (!Q.doraemon_narrated) {
            dialogues.push(["doraemon", "Why am I narrating? Uhh, look, man, somebody has to!"]);
            Q.doraemon_narrated = 1;
        }

        var id = window.queueCombatCutscene(dialogues);
        Q.combat_cutscene_queue.push(id);
    }
} else {
    Q[Q.selected_combatant+"_plan"] = "parry";
}

!}
go-to: menu if planning_combat

<div class="combat-advisor-screen">

[+ sc_display +] will, at the cost of 2 stamina attempt the parry the next attack with his Scythian saber, which will slice through triangles, reflect orbs, but be useless against lasers.

</div>

- @menu: Return

@diplomacy
title: Diplomacy
subtitle: Spend turn negotiating a treaty with the Gold Trigon. Will buy others a turn, but be guaranteed hit by the Gold Trigon's next attack. [? if sc_plan == "diplomacy" : - **this is our plan** ?]
on-arrival: {!
if (!Q.planning_combat) {
    window.clearCombatStatsIfNeeded();
    Q[Q.selected_combatant + "_action"] = "diplomacy";

    if (Q.selected_combatant == "breitscheid") {
        Q.breitscheid_diplomacies = (Q.breitscheid_diplomacies || 0) + 1;

        var diplomacyDialogues = {
            1: [
                ["breitscheid", "Greetings, mister or missus sir or madame of the trifecta of cosmic geometry. We in Germany hold the utmost respect for the underlying mythopoetic psychocosmology and sinister sworcery and burdensome books and haunted deathless darkness and most of all the woeful errand which motivates your current presence within the realm that we here call as Germany, and it is my hope that we can reach a cordial understanding that will render us as cosmic friends forever.|"],
                ["breitscheid", "For your consideration.|||"],
                ["trigon", ".|.|.|"],
                ["breitscheid", "...Not much of a talker, huh?|"],
                ["breitscheid", "That's okay, I'm familiar with nonverbal negotiations as well. Especially when they're with cosmic deities, because I can really get a sense of what they mean to communicate.|"],
                ["trigon", ".|.|.|"],
                ["breitscheid", "Maybe we're anthropomorphizing too much, though. I feel like you probably don't have motivations in the sense of human comprehension. You're more of an object than a being. Not to insult your graciousness, of course. I personally have several friends with it/its pronouns.|"],
                ["trigon", ".|.|.|"],
                ["breitscheid", "...you're gonna attack me next, aren't you?||"],
                ["doraemon", "Negotiations have fallen apart!"],
            ],
            2: [
                ["breitscheid", "Though our prior negotiations were a failure, it is my aim to nevertheless negotiate a treatise that will put an end to our combat and instead establish a mutual understanding through which our woeful errands can be enacted in the absence of detrimental combat.|"],
                ["breitscheid", "I have drafted a convention, which I will present to mister or missus sir or madame trigon, through which we may in feature engage in dialogue to resolve disputes. We would also like to take a moment to commemorate your contributions to German Social Democracy, mainly in incinerating Hitler.|"],
                ["breitscheid", "I believe we may reach an agreement in which these powers may be harnessed, through the Megatome as medium, towards aims in line with those of the German working class, and the people of the world as a whole.|"],
                ["trigon", "|.|.|.|"],
                ["breitscheid", "If you will please take this document, in which I have outlined the conventions, that I am tentatively calling the Breitscheid-Trifecta Treaty of Friendship...|"],
                ["trigon", "|.|.|.|"],
                ["breitscheid", "There.|"],
                ["trigon", "|.|.|.|.|.|.|.|.|.|.|"],
                ["doraemon", "(Is it...reviewing the terms?)|"],
                ["trigon", "|.|.|.|.|"],
                ["doraemon", "(O-Oh. It incinerated the paper.)|"],
                ["breitscheid", "Well then."],
                ["doraemon", "Negotiations have fallen apart!"],
            ],
            3: [
                ["breitscheid", "It is my dream that we may manage to cast all our prior misunderstandings aside and see you join our Megatome as a force of good.|"],
                ["trigon", "|.|.|.|.|"],
                ["breitscheid", ".|.|.|you know, I might as well not delude myself about my function here."],
                ["doraemon", "Negotiations have fallen apart!"],
            ],
        };

        var dialogues = diplomacyDialogues[Q.breitscheid_diplomacies] || [
            ["breitscheid", "We come in peace!"],
            ["trigon", "|.|.|.|.|"],
            ["doraemon", "Negotiations have fallen apart!"],
        ];

        if (!Q.doraemon_narrated) {
            dialogues.push(["doraemon", "Why am I narrating? Uhh, look, man, somebody has to!"]);
            Q.doraemon_narrated = 1;
        }

        var id = window.queueCombatCutscene(dialogues);
        Q.combat_cutscene_queue.push(id);
    }
} else {
    Q[Q.selected_combatant+"_plan"] = "diplomacy";
}
!}
go-to: menu if planning_combat

<div class="combat-advisor-screen">

[+ sc_display +] will attempt to negotiate a treaty with the **<span style="color:rgb(255, 208, 0);font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.5px;">Gold Trigon</span>** to put an end to the fighting, using his diplomatic skills to do so. The **<span style="color:rgb(255, 208, 0);font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.5px;">Gold Trigon</span>** seems adverse to communication, perhaps due to autism, and will likely withdraw from talks and attack the messenger.

</div>

